                <pb facs="0660" n="610" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg610"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-17"><hi rendition="#italic">June 17,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Taylor informs the Department that he has received official notice from the
                    president of the council stating that telegraphic orders have been sent to Cuba
                    and Puerto Rico putting definitive repertory into immediate effect.</p>
            </div>
